    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Year 1823. Northern Yakutia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Young naval officer Nikolai Trofimov embarks on a perilous journey to the edge of the known world in search of his missing father. His quest leads him deep into the icy tundra and toward the legendary Sannikov Land \u2014 a mythical island of eternal peace and prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Nikolai ventures further north, aided by the resilience of his companions \u2014 both human and animal \u2014 he begins to uncover secrets that blur the lines between myth and reality. In this unforgiving wilderness, the past is as alive as the spirits that haunt it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/33750a99f73eba618413bdec4c779dba.poster.avif?t=1741680540\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/33750a99f73eba618413bdec4c779dba.webm?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/33750a99f73eba618413bdec4c779dba.mp4?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUNT, SURVIVE, AND MASTER THE WILDS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yakutia's wilderness is teeming with life, but survival demands skill and determination. Each of the four regions holds its own unique fauna \u2014 from elusive animals to prized fish \u2014 waiting to challenge even the most seasoned hunter.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/f210ea809dba744eb0ecda171b44fb1b.poster.avif?t=1741680540\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/f210ea809dba744eb0ecda171b44fb1b.webm?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/f210ea809dba744eb0ecda171b44fb1b.mp4?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD THE ULTIMATE DOG SLED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in the Far North depends on preparation and ingenuity. Earn money from your hunts to invest in better gear, gather materials to enhance your sled, and expand your team of loyal dogs. Meet new breeds and form lasting bonds with your canine companions, whether through trade or by completing special tasks to win their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/4a3a91fa3dea79b3327794060a19fb63.poster.avif?t=1741680540\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/4a3a91fa3dea79b3327794060a19fb63.webm?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/4a3a91fa3dea79b3327794060a19fb63.mp4?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNRAVEL THE SECRETS OF YOUR HERITAGE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yakutia is a land of legend, and its tales intertwine with your family\u2019s mysterious past. As you complete quests and connect with the locals, you\u2019ll uncover the truth about your father\u2019s disappearance, your family\u2019s noble rise, and the whispers of immortality that surround the Trofimov name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/1f8ee9f272359e71de9bef12b2f4c1f5.poster.avif?t=1741680540\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/1f8ee9f272359e71de9bef12b2f4c1f5.webm?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/1f8ee9f272359e71de9bef12b2f4c1f5.mp4?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MYTHS AND REALITY COLLIDE IN THE FROZEN NORTH</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world where the rich culture of the Yakut people comes alive. Encounter spirits from ancient folklore, face the terrifying abaasy demons, and navigate a land where nature and myth exist in delicate balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/d7b1f408798e56c42f73a6a74dba65f2.poster.avif?t=1741680540\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/d7b1f408798e56c42f73a6a74dba65f2.webm?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/d7b1f408798e56c42f73a6a74dba65f2.mp4?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ANSWER THE CALL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the breathtaking yet treacherous landscapes of northern Yakutia. Test your courage against the unforgiving elements, forge bonds with the people and animals of this frozen land, and uncover the ultimate truth hidden in the enigmatic Sannikov Land. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/74f1ac5aee784954e0d8bdec132a4226.poster.avif?t=1741680540\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/74f1ac5aee784954e0d8bdec132a4226.webm?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/74f1ac5aee784954e0d8bdec132a4226.mp4?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Year 1823. Northern Yakutia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Young naval officer Nikolai Trofimov embarks on a perilous journey to the edge of the known world in search of his missing father. His quest leads him deep into the icy tundra and toward the legendary Sannikov Land \u2014 a mythical island of eternal peace and prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Nikolai ventures further north, aided by the resilience of his companions \u2014 both human and animal \u2014 he begins to uncover secrets that blur the lines between myth and reality. In this unforgiving wilderness, the past is as alive as the spirits that haunt it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/33750a99f73eba618413bdec4c779dba.poster.avif?t=1741680540\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/33750a99f73eba618413bdec4c779dba.webm?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/33750a99f73eba618413bdec4c779dba.mp4?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUNT, SURVIVE, AND MASTER THE WILDS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yakutia's wilderness is teeming with life, but survival demands skill and determination. Each of the four regions holds its own unique fauna \u2014 from elusive animals to prized fish \u2014 waiting to challenge even the most seasoned hunter.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/f210ea809dba744eb0ecda171b44fb1b.poster.avif?t=1741680540\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste