0\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/74f1ac5aee784954e0d8bdec132a4226.webm?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/74f1ac5aee784954e0d8bdec132a4226.mp4?t=1741680540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
